        legal action, \r\nincluding without limitation pursuing civil, criminal,
        and \r\ninjunctive redress.\r\n\r\n9. BUYERS RIGHTS\r\nBuyers receive a cryptographic
        token representing the \r\nSeller\u2019s digital assets as a version of property,
