        royalty-free license to \r\ndisplay the Digital assets legally owned and
        properly \r\nobtained by the Buyer.\r\n\r\n9.1 Physical Assets x Digital
        assets\r\nIt is important to bear in mind that Buyers have the rights \r\nto
        the digital assets (NFT Version) not to the physical \r\nassets. When you
        buy a digital asset, you own only the \r\ndigital assets, not the copyright
