        buy the \r\ndigital assets you can resell it, it is yours to resell or keep,
        \r\nbut again the copyright and intellectual property belongs \r\nto the
        artist (owner). That being said, don\u2019t make \r\nconfusion between your
        rights to the NFT Version and \r\nphysical Assets. The Buyer\u2019s limited
        license to display the \r\nDigital assets, includes, but is not limited to,
